m&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQmXjp-dKrT4_59fUzFpRnYIUJ0N9W_Lf4ng3ksvQQiag&oe=6AF745E2"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2109492799978791", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_2109492803312124_6168041457191444923_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kX3uZM6t86YQ7kNvwHgKZAj&_nc_oc=Ado1WSqknlx54d7aVi4djX-vSkgYsdD28-5WnBRQTPOX700HNGJQTD9FAIXWtnTDK3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSIqcXb0Pf-kbsi5sc4GonD9H07x0Et6KoUAKhseM4kzw&oe=6AF71A43"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1009420911937123", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593858738_1009420918603789_7770799512677328953_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1p6Of06EEqwQ7kNvwHD_J0J&_nc_oc=AdrK29aQU_khmPvWrDLueQJkI-jAZeb6Be2sKqYfx9ASN1rIYoToNK3B5HqL90w5B7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTOVi4m7pRQm2ePMIB3WNkz6qndLzed49N6KVtm9jky5Q&oe=6AF7468A"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1568603708105724", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_1568603711439057_6638901497728289888_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mAiax0iSsS4Q7kNvwFIqDik&_nc_oc=Adp39Ze3Nn6rRIXXs93DmB6z-sd0-nxmysvn9OKAOsTn8CXrzXMvsqiNanVM6bjry4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAXlkOsBB9PtzGZWBOx8IThNMl2mTcvV09DhQqY5-5Fw&oe=6AF74995"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1666228574484583", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_1666228577817916_4801998343550850000_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pzGM2IFn5Z4Q7kNvwGegriZ&_nc_oc=Adq2aZLhHWMv6gLuL3hDUwBz3hGz0D60RIv9gwjJofajCAHGvR4uQV1o9nueHtmZt64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5mYRc7D3Cga4GlP7hZrYdBKjYQHl3ogYgKia9SejtfA&oe=6AF73CFD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Formula Velocity VR", "keywords": ["FormulaCar", "OpenWheelVR", "VRRacing", "CockpitRacing", "RacingSimulator"], "long_description": "Formula Velocity VR is the formula car racing experience Meta Quest has been waiting for.\nSlide into a fully immersive open-wheel cockpit, grip the virtual steering wheel with your own hands, and push a high-performance formula car to its absolute limit. Every corner, every overtake \u2014 felt in full VR.\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Three Hand-Crafted Circuits\nThree tracks built ground-up for VR \u2014 tight street sections, sweeping high-speed corners, and technical infields that challenge every skill level.\n\ud83c\udfae True VR \u2014 No Compromises\nDesigned exclusively for Meta Quest. Motion controller steering, a detailed working cockpit, and comfort settings tuned to keep you racing longer.\n\ud83e\udd16 Single Player Career\nEscalating AI difficulty, career events, achievements, and leaderboards. From first lap to podium finisher.\n\ud83c\udf0d Global Multiplayer\nReal-time wheel-to-wheel racing against drivers worldwide. Draft, defend, and fight for the win.\n\u26a1 Realistic Handling\nTire management, slipstreaming, late braking \u2014 deep enough to reward precision, accessible enough from lap one.\nAt a Glance: 3 VR circuits \u00b7 Open-wheel cockpit \u00b7 Motion controller steering \u00b7 Career mode \u00b7 Global multiplayer \u00b7 Car customization \u00b7 Leaderboards\nBuckle up. The lights are out. Go.", "short_description": "Strap into the cockpit and feel true speed. Formula Velocity VR puts you behind the wheel of open-wheel formula cars across 3 hand-crafted circuits \u2014 with realistic physics, AI rivals, and pulse-pounding multiplayer. Built exclusively for VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id":